00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:37.170
All right, there's ultraviolet
radiation from the Sun.

00:06:37.170 --> 00:06:40.380
It's not shielded by the
ozone in an atmosphere.

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:42.240
So, it sterilizes.

00:06:42.240 --> 00:06:43.720
Ultraviolet and life,

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:46.000
